          </p>

          <div style="display: inline-grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; text-align: left; max-width: 800px; width: 100%;">
            <div class="card">
              <span style="color: var(--accent-cyan); font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.85rem;">АВТОРЛАР:</span>
